# Installed skills are not committed: skills-lock.json (committed) is the source of
# truth for which external skills are used and at which commit. Skills authored in
# this repository stay tracked via explicit "!" exceptions below.
# .claude/skills/ holds the CLI's links to .agents/skills/.
.agents/skills/*
!.agents/skills/verified-research/
.claude/skills/
